       Identification Division.                                         00010000
       Program-ID. F115ISR0.                                            00020000
       Author.  Henning Langfeldt Rødland.                              00030000
      *################################################################*00040000
      *                                                                 00050000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00060000
      *                                                                 00070000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Sys_Code_Rel.     00080000
      *                                                                 00090000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00100000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00110000
      * from- and to- values.                                           00120000
      *                                                                 00130000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00140000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00150000
      *                                                                 00160000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00170000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00180000
      *      See seperate description below.                            00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      *                                                                 00210000
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00220000
      *                                                                 00230000
      *    Initialize                          R115ISR0-Sys-Code-Rel    00240000
      *    Set   R115ISR0-Version        To    True                     00250000
      *    Set   R115ISR0-In-Select      To    True                     00260000
      *    Move  &from sys-type          To    R115ISR0-In-From-ST-Type 00270000
      *    Move  &from sys-code          To    R115ISR0-In-From-SC-Code 00280000
      *    Move  &to sys-type            To    R115ISR0-In-To-ST-Type   00290000
      *    Move  &to sys-code            To    R115ISR0-In-To-SC-Code   00300000
      *    Move  &relation-type          To    R115ISR0-In-Rel-Type     00310000
      *                                                                 00320000
      *    Call  'F115ISR0'              Using R115ISR0-Sys-Code-Rel    00330000
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00340000
      *    End-Call                                                     00350000
      *                                                                 00360000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00370000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00380000
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00390000
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00400000
      *                                                                 00410000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00420000
      *        ...not found...                                          00430000
      *                                                                 00440000
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00450000
      *        ...found...                                              00460000
      *                                                                 00470000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00480000
      *                                                                 00490000
      *################################################################*00500000
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00510000
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00520000
      *140201!HLR! Tuning - Replaced all the cursors.            !    ! 00530000
      *      !   !        - Key-fields "shuffled".               !    ! 00540000
      *      !   !        - From- / To-F-I-ID removed, and       !    ! 00550000
      *      !   !          replaced by Fin-Inst-ID.             !    ! 00560000
      *070900!NDL! Must qualify with from-st-type                !LR02! 00570000
      *170399!HLR! New module                                    !LG10! 00580000
      *################################################################*00590000
       Environment Division.                                            00600000
