               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)03540000
               Move  R115ISR0-In-Action  To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)03550000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               03560000
               Move  'C001'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       03570000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       03580000
      *                                                                 03590000
           End-Evaluate                                                 03600000
