           Move  +0                      To    W-Tally                  03950000
           Inspect WE-To-Type           Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'03960000
           If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       03970000
               Inspect WE-To-Type        Converting '* ' to '%%'        03980000
