           Inspect WE-From-Code         Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'04120000
           If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       04130000
               Inspect WE-From-Code      Converting '* ' to '%%'        04140000
           End-If                                                       04150000
      *                                                                 04160000
           Move  R115ISR0-In-To-SC-Code  To    WE-To-Code               04170000
           Move  +0                      To    W-Tally                  04180000
           Inspect WE-To-Code           Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'04190000
           If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       04200000
               Inspect WE-To-Code        Converting '* ' to '%%'        04210000
           End-If                                                       04220000
      *                                                                 04230000
           Move  R115ISR0-In-From-Contr-Type                            04240000
                                         To    WE-From-Contr-Type       04250000
           Move  R115ISR0-In-To-Contr-Type                              04260000
                                         To    WE-To-Contr-Type         04270000
      *                                                                 04280000
           .                                                            04290000
      *################################################################.04300000
       D200-Prepare-Qualification        Section.                       04310000
      *                                                                 04320000
      * We store the qualification, so that we can check that the       04330000
