      *                                                                 04450000
           Move  WE-Fin-Inst-Id          To    W-DB-Fin-Inst-Id         04460000
      *                                                                 04470000
           Move  WE-From-Type            To    W-DB-From-Type           04480000
           Move  WE-To-Type              To    W-DB-To-Type             04490000
