           Move  WE-Rel-Type             To    W-DB-Rel-Type            04510000
      *                                                                 04520000
           Move  WE-From-Code            To    W-DB-From-Code           04530000
           Move  WE-To-Code              To    W-DB-To-Code             04540000
      *                                                                 04550000
KUTT  *    Move  WE-From-Contr-Type      To    W-DB-From-Contr-Type     04560000
KUTT  *    Move  WE-To-Contr-Type        To    W-DB-To-Contr-Type       04570000
KUTT  *                                                                 04580000
           If  WE-Fin-Inst-No            Not = Space                    04590000
           and W-DB-Fin-Inst-Id          =     +0                       04600000
               Move  WE-Fin-Inst-No      To    W-Fin-Inst-No            04610000
